  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_02
    value: SCATTER
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_02
    value: At least 1 Scatter on 3 or more consecutive reels from reel 1 triggers
      <style=coinColor>Gimme a Piggy Free Games</style>.
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_03
    value: JACKPOT REEL FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_03
    value: "Jackpot Reel is an Extra Reel, which stays active during each spin and
      can award one of the followings: \n- <indent=1em>One of four Jackpots</indent>\n-
      <indent=1em>Random Jackpot that will turn into one of four Jackpots</indent>\n-
      <indent=1em>Cash Prize</indent>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_04
    value: GIMME A PIGGY FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_04
    value: 'Scatter Symbol appears on all reels.


      At least 1 Scatter on 3
      or more consecutive reels from reel 1 triggers <style=coinColor>Gimme a Piggy
      Free Games</style>.


      Each Scatter appears with Coin Prize.


      The
      sum of Coin Prizes on triggering Scatters is calculated and will be used as
      <style=coinColor>Cash Prize</style> for each Cash Symbol         during Gimme
      a Piggy Free Games.


      During Gimme a Piggy Free Games, each         on
      a reel awards Cash Prize.


      Also, each          randomly awards +1 Free
      Game.'
